  "overview": {
    "title": "Space and a horizon view",
    "p1": "Sfiha Beach offers a wider band of sand than the central Quemado strip, with a more open feel and views out toward the Peñón de Alhucemas islet on the horizon.",
    "p2": "Families favour it for space and a slightly calmer atmosphere. Services appear in season; the setting remains classic Mediterranean Rif coast.",
    "p3": "Pair a Sfiha afternoon with a morning at Cala Bonita, or use it as your main swim base if you prefer more room than town-centre sand."
